  message: "Part B (D2 / WI-gubar) landed in PR #407 (dev 3e11c3ca17): @property attribute reads (obj.prop on a var_types-typed instance) now resolve to the in-repo getter via the receiver_type_hint -> inherited_calls Site-2 chain. Behavioral evidence: ValidationResult.ok (a flagship repro) now has an incoming resolved calls edge (was dead). WI-noham STAYS OPEN — the inherited-method mass still needs the Python MRO walker (WI-hiziz/D1), which is the last piece before the 283-twin residual fully clears; read-write getter+setter properties are deferred to WI-sizut. Session arc: WI-noham Part A (PR #404) + WI-gubar/D2 (PR #407) landed; remaining to close = WI-hiziz/D1 (+ WI-supat/D3 precision)."  # a580
